Subject: [PATCH v5 2/3] dmaengine: Extend the dma_slave_width for 128 bytes
Date:   Thu, 29 Jul 2021 09:25:19 +0100
Message-Id: <20210729082520.26186-3-biju.das.jz@bp.renesas.com>
